{
  "version": 1,
  "source_hash": 3477419394564522773,
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Zulip Meeting Management",
      "source_hash": 16523001016542868886,
      "context_hash": 4487975803203829610,
      "translation": "Zulip 회의 관리",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Zulip": "Zulip"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T13:18:43.699384Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Triagebot can respond to some commands in Zulip to assist with running a meeting.",
      "source_hash": 1170688393778788705,
      "context_hash": 15927189394245868872,
      "translation": "Triagebot은 회의 진행을 돕기 위해 Zulip에서 일부 명령에 응답할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Zulip": "Zulip",
        "triagebot": "triagebot"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T13:18:43.699384Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Usage",
      "source_hash": 8769925957682373409,
      "context_hash": 855167235505196479,
      "translation": "사용법",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:47:10.089205Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Enter a message in Zulip addressed to `@triagebot` with a command listed below.",
      "source_hash": 13886819946505912775,
      "context_hash": 9699002793299591574,
      "translation": "`@triagebot`을 수신자로 하여 아래에 나열된 명령을 Zulip 메시지로 입력하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Zulip": "Zulip"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T13:18:43.699385Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "Document reading",
      "source_hash": 2831813935497825976,
      "context_hash": 11237467475978162969,
      "translation": "문서 읽기",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:47:10.089205Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "This command will cause triagebot to post a comment to poll when everyone is finished reading some document, and are ready to start discussing it.",
      "source_hash": 10745256618275792375,
      "context_hash": 644536170386132227,
      "translation": "이 명령은 모든 사람이 어떤 문서 읽기를 마치고 논의를 시작할 준비가 되었는지 투표하는 댓글을 triagebot이 게시하도록 합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "triagebot": "triagebot"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T13:18:43.699385Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:4/seg:1",
      "source": "The message looks something like:",
      "source_hash": 7148969259413721914,
      "context_hash": 2481423382810664401,
      "translation": "메시지는 다음과 비슷하게 보입니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:47:10.089205Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "Users can then click the emoji reaction buttons to indicate that they are currently reading, and then again when they are finished.",
      "source_hash": 1029780498578902565,
      "context_hash": 7666973925257508449,
      "translation": "그러면 사용자는 이모지 반응 버튼을 클릭하여 현재 읽고 있음을 표시하고, 다 읽었을 때 다시 클릭할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:47:10.089205Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:7/seg:0",
      "source": "End topic",
      "source_hash": 14133691179977952617,
      "context_hash": 16179974094124551046,
      "translation": "주제 종료",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:47:10.089205Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:9/seg:0",
      "source": "This command will cause triagebot to post a comment to poll if everyone in the meeting is ready to move on to the next topic.",
      "source_hash": 5888316653523500069,
      "context_hash": 4712183912799399944,
      "translation": "이 명령은 회의 참석자 전원이 다음 주제로 넘어갈 준비가 되었는지 투표하는 댓글을 triagebot이 게시하도록 합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "triagebot": "triagebot"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T13:18:43.699385Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:9/seg:1",
      "source": "The message looks something like:",
      "source_hash": 7148969259413721914,
      "context_hash": 5814545950034917145,
      "translation": "메시지는 다음과 비슷하게 보입니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:47:10.089205Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:11/seg:0",
      "source": "Users can then click the emoji reaction buttons to indicate if they are ready or not.",
      "source_hash": 6111038025831995615,
      "context_hash": 11366956410032456926,
      "translation": "그러면 사용자는 이모지 반응 버튼을 클릭하여 준비가 되었는지 여부를 표시할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:47:10.089205Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:12/seg:0",
      "source": "`@triagebot await` is an alias for `end-topic`.",
      "source_hash": 7524115150372330186,
      "context_hash": 3741975020486990240,
      "translation": "`@triagebot await`는 `end-topic`의 별칭입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:47:10.089205Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:13/seg:0",
      "source": "End meeting",
      "source_hash": 9689659368803975247,
      "context_hash": 13301050030011590411,
      "translation": "회의 종료",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:47:10.089206Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:15/seg:0",
      "source": "This command will cause triagebot to post a comment to poll if everyone is ready to end the meeting.",
      "source_hash": 15890693149155789293,
      "context_hash": 9256689179819920091,
      "translation": "이 명령은 모든 사람이 회의를 마칠 준비가 되었는지 투표하는 댓글을 triagebot이 게시하도록 합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "triagebot": "triagebot"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T13:18:43.699385Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:15/seg:1",
      "source": "The message looks something like:",
      "source_hash": 7148969259413721914,
      "context_hash": 13028931729036360714,
      "translation": "메시지는 다음과 비슷하게 보입니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:47:10.089206Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:17/seg:0",
      "source": "Users can then click the emoji reaction buttons to indicate if they are ready to end or not.",
      "source_hash": 8533486033576544150,
      "context_hash": 17978435200560239642,
      "translation": "그러면 사용자는 이모지 반응 버튼을 클릭하여 종료 준비가 되었는지 여부를 표시할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:47:10.089206Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Configuration",
      "source_hash": 4935613502183038470,
      "context_hash": 3732254515586222545,
      "translation": "설정",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:47:10.089206Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "This feature has no configuration, it is available to all team members.",
      "source_hash": 8527360427742274166,
      "context_hash": 542716146413411861,
      "translation": "이 기능은 별도의 설정이 없으며, 모든 팀원이 사용할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:47:10.089206Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "Note that your Zulip ID needs to be configured in the [teams database](https://github.com/rust-lang/team).",
      "source_hash": 16917065860362848408,
      "context_hash": 4082245156420311723,
      "translation": "여러분의 Zulip ID는 [팀 데이터베이스](https://github.com/rust-lang/team)에 등록되어 있어야 한다는 점에 유의하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Zulip": "Zulip"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T13:18:43.699386Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Implementation",
      "source_hash": 14188291987651099077,
      "context_hash": 7390969869791925266,
      "translation": "구현",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:47:10.089206Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "See [`src/zulip.rs`](https://github.com/rust-lang/triagebot/blob/HEAD/src/zulip.rs).",
      "source_hash": 8646301435206365869,
      "context_hash": 5801226501789644448,
      "translation": "[`src/zulip.rs`](https://github.com/rust-lang/triagebot/blob/HEAD/src/zulip.rs)를 참고하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:47:10.089206Z",
      "issues": []
    }
  ]
}